    "Or use the RandProtocol provers — %lld machines run by the validators, each with its own key. They charge nothing. %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Or use the RandProtocol provers — %1$lld machines run by the validators, each with its own key. They charge nothing. %2$@"
